         } else if (mode == 'X') {
-            /* 2026-05-19 diagnostic: parametric reconfig with rublock-
-             * register echo-check.  Reads 8 hex digits as a full 29-bit
-             * payload (mask 0x1FFFFFFF), shifts it in non-destructively,
